      "height": 1024,
      "bytes": 1298486,
      "level": "Moderate",
      "intent": "Use a calm code header with JavaScript dropdown, optional Wrap control, Copy and Open in text editor. A compact language-search popover uses readable names and identifiers with a clear selected row. Show a copied confirmation as a quiet text state. Pins: 1 language is an explicit control; 2 wrapping reduces horizontal friction; 3 copy feedback is understandable. Dark slate surfaces, no neon.",
      "annotations": [
        "Language is an explicit control",
        "Wrapping reduces horizontal friction",
        "Copy feedback is understandable"
      ]
    }
  ],
